🇷🇺🇺🇦⚡ A map of Russian strikes on Ukrainian power infrastructure facilities for August–October 2026. Recorded strikes by month:
🟢 August – 76;
🟢 September – 93;
🟢 October – 227. In addition to power plants and large trunk substations, thanks to loitering UAVs the Russian Armed Forces have begun to more actively attack small substations and power transmission lines. Whereas in August the main targets were frontline and border regions, from September–October the strikes spread to central and weste
